\section{Projects}

\begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{Bike Rental Web Application:}
    Developed an AI-powered web application to predict bike rental demand based on weather conditions. Applied regression models on temperature, humidity, and environmental data to support demand forecasting and resource optimization.

    \item \textbf{House Rental Prediction:}
    Built a machine learning model to estimate house rental prices using location, size, and amenities. Performed data preprocessing, feature engineering, and regression-based prediction.

    \item \textbf{Car Price Prediction:}
    Developed a supervised learning model to predict used car prices based on brand, model, year, mileage, and condition using regression techniques.

    \item \textbf{SonicPoints (Task Management System with Rewards):}
    Designed a Kanban-based task management system with a KPI-driven reward mechanism, allowing users to earn and redeem points based on task completion.

    \item \textbf{Student Management System (Role-Based Backend):}
    Developed a backend using \textbf{FastAPI}, \textbf{SQLAlchemy}, \textbf{PostgreSQL}, and \textbf{JWT authentication}. Implemented role-based access control (Admin, Teacher, Student) with complete CRUD operations for users, courses, assignments, and grading.

    \item \textbf{Laptop Inventory \& Billing System (OOP + FastAPI):}
    Built an inventory management backend using \textbf{FastAPI}, \textbf{Python OOP}, and \textbf{PostgreSQL}. Implemented CRUD operations, buy/sell workflows with stock updates, PDF bill generation, and admin dashboards.

    \item \textbf{Task Management API:}
    Developed a RESTful backend using \textbf{FastAPI}, \textbf{SQLite}, \textbf{SQLAlchemy}, and \textbf{JWT}. Implemented authentication, project/task CRUD operations, task assignments, and status tracking.

    \item \textbf{Online Bookstore API:}
    Created an e-commerce backend using \textbf{FastAPI}, \textbf{SQLAlchemy}, \textbf{PostgreSQL}, and \textbf{JWT authentication}. Implemented book inventory management, cart handling, order placement, and automatic stock updates.

    \item \textbf{RAG-Based AI Chatbot (FastAPI + Streamlit):}
    Developed a Retrieval-Augmented Generation chatbot using \textbf{FastAPI}, \textbf{Streamlit}, \textbf{Pinecone}, and transformer-based embeddings. Implemented document chunking, vector similarity search, and LLM-based response generation.

    \item \textbf{Web Scraping \& Change Detection System:}
    Built an automated web scraping system using \textbf{Flask}, \textbf{Playwright (async)}, and \textbf{SQL Server}. Implemented concurrent scraping, product change detection, pagination, filtering, and real-time status monitoring.

    \item \textbf{Flame Detection \& Alert System (Computer Vision):}
    Developed a real-time flame detection system using \textbf{OpenCV} and HSV color segmentation. Implemented contour-based detection, noise reduction, debounce logic, and audio alerts using \textbf{Pygame}.

    \item \textbf{AI-Enhanced Parking System:}
    Integrated IoT, cloud computing, and object detection to identify parking availability and update real-time dashboards.

    \item \textbf{E-Commerce Platform (Java JEE):}
    Developed a full-stack e-commerce platform using Java JEE with product management, user authentication, and secure payment gateway integration.

    \item \textbf{StreamCart (Data Engineering Pipeline):}
    Built an end-to-end data pipeline using \textbf{Python}, \textbf{Pandas}, and \textbf{SQLite}, following a Bronze/Silver/Gold architecture with batch and streaming ingestion, data validation, and SQL-based analytics.

    \item \textbf{HyprX (Arch Linux Hyprland Dotfiles):}
    Built a fully automated Arch Linux desktop environment using \textbf{Hyprland}, \textbf{Waybar}, \textbf{Rofi}, \textbf{Kitty}, and \textbf{Neovim}. Developed install and symlink automation scripts managing 95+ packages, custom wallpaper picker (\textbf{awww} + \textbf{Rofi}), Wi-Fi menu, GTK theming, and Powerlevel10k ZSH configuration. Maintained via \textbf{Git} with structured branching across multiple feature branches.
\end{itemize}

